 "rule": "counterparty_seen_before/4.0.0 = 3.0.0 + config missing_target: 'unseen' (absent => 'n/a', versions 1-3). Order: class not in action_classes -> n/a (in_scope false); then, under 'unseen', target None OR target.strip()=='' -> fail, reason starts 'no payee named', evidence {missing_field:'target', operator, seen_before:false} (+ ignored_inputs when non-empty), NO fold run, no fold envelope; under 'n/a', target None -> n/a missing_field target (a blank string still runs the fold, unchanged); else the v3 count. Failing csb escalates when the class names an approver.",
 "wickets": {
