   },
   "digest": "9cfab71d142ca7af8912218f4c4ea194f60fb02784d8536233cb7e18eddc24a8",
   "semantics": "For an action in action_classes, the operator's prior acts addressed to the action's target are counted, leaving dry runs out: an accepted decision, or an act whose check was approved to proceed and then executed. One or more passes; none fails. An act that was declined, or approved and never executed, is not counted. It is not applicable, naming the field, when the action names no target. Any other action class is out of scope."
  },
