   },
   "digest": "c7c20d9e57cb0a75184b9c6c4d037c9bea813a7b1105c581defd4481acf964b0",
   "semantics": "For an action in action_classes, the operator's prior acts addressed to the action's target are counted, leaving dry runs out: an accepted decision, or an act whose check was approved to proceed and then executed. One or more passes; none fails. An act that was declined, or approved and never executed, is not counted. An action that names no target, or a target that is empty or only whitespace, fails as a first-time counterparty, with the reason no payee named. Any other action class is out of scope."
  }
